(text "All three sensors run 4-wire SPI on the shared SENS_SCK / SENS_MOSI / SENS_MISO bus with one chip select each,\nand are powered from V3V3_ANA (TPS7A20 LDO). Every supply pin on this sheet gets 100 nF + 1 uF: BMP581 and\nADXL375 because their own datasheets call for the pair, the ICM-45686 as a deliberate addition - its\ndatasheet BOM (DS-000577 Rev 1.0 Table 11) lists 0.1 uF only." (at 15 10 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3a074f63-490c-58d3-adf3-18aa54ada30b))
